<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <title>Rural Homestay Guide</title>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <style>
      body { font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 650px; margin: 40px auto; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.6; color: #222; }
      .card { border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px; border-radius: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; display: block; text-decoration: none; color: #333; transition: border-color 0.2s; }
      .card:hover { border-color: #0b6623; background-color: #f9fbf9; }
      h1 { color: #0b6623; }
      h2 { margin-top: 30px; font-size: 1.2rem; color: #555; border-bottom: 2px solid #eee; padding-bottom: 5px; }
    </style>
  </head>
<!-- Floating WhatsApp Button -->
<a 
  href="https://wa.me/919886630878?text=Hi!%20I%20have%20feedback%20on%20the%20Rural%20Homestay%20Guide:" 
  class="whatsapp-float" 
  target="_blank" 
  rel="noopener noreferrer"
  aria-label="Send feedback on WhatsApp"
>
  💬 Feedback on WhatsApp
</a>

<style>
  .whatsapp-float {
    position: fixed;
    bottom: 20px;
    right: 20px;
    background-color: #25d366;
    color: white;
    padding: 12px 18px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    box-shadow: 0px 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
    z-index: 1000;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    transition: transform 0.2s ease, background-color 0.2s ease;
  }
  .whatsapp-float:hover {
    background-color: #128c7e;
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }
</style>

  <body>
    <h1>Open Source Rural Homestay and Immersion Guide</h1>
    <p>A practical handbook empowering rural hosts to build sustainable, economically viable, and culturally conscious homestay programs.</p>

    <h2>1. Operational & Experience Modules</h2>

    <a href="/readiness" class="card">
      <strong>📋 Village Readiness Checklist</strong>
      <p>Assess host preparedness, sanitation, and community consent.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/fixed-itinerary" class="card">
      <strong>🗓️ Fixed Itineraries & Stay Logistics</strong>
      <p>3 & 7-day day-wise plans, transit guides, washroom & network reality.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/local-experiences" class="card">
      <strong>🌾 Local Experiences & Community Giving</strong>
      <p>Foraging walks, artisan workshops, village pantry, and giving back.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/culture" class="card">
      <strong>🌿 Cultural Rules & Eco-Protocols</strong>
      <p>Chemical insect repellent rules, terrain packing lists, and guest briefs.</p>
    </a>

    <a href="/digital-setup" class="card">
      <strong>📱 Zero-Cost Digital Setup</strong>
      <p>Google Maps pinning, WhatsApp Business setup, and direct UPI QR payments.</p>
    </a>

    <h2>2. Interactive Tools</h2>

    <a href="/calculator" class="card">
      <strong>🧮 Pricing Calculator</strong>
      <p>Calculate sustainable per-night rates, meal costs, and community fund shares.</p>
    </a>
  </body>
</html>
